Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.03,0:00:04.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}On March 1st, 18 years ago,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.89,0:00:08.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Hinazuki was standing alone at this park as always.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}It was a little before 6 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.30,0:00:16.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I headed for the hideout back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.11,0:00:19.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I think I went to get my gloves.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.34,0:00:23.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I don't remember whether\NI actually found them there.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.50,0:00:26.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}When I left the hideout and glanced\Ntowards the river bank,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I saw Yuuki-san sitting there, facing the water.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.86,0:00:34.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}And by the time I took the shortest\Nroute back and passed by the park,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Hinazuki was gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the blackboard, class.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.03,0:00:49.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}A week from now, Hinazuki Kayo will become the\Nfirst victim in a serial kidnapping and murder case.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On X-Day.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.01,0:00:54.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can make sure nothing\Nhappens on March 1st,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.78,0:00:57.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and have a birthday party\Nwith Hinazuki the next day,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that will definitely mean\NI've changed the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.17,0:01:03.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll erase those crimes from the history books.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.65,0:02:39.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.72,0:02:43.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Breakfast will be done in a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.43,0:02:44.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.54,0:02:46.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.45,0:02:50.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.72,0:02:54.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to go out on Saturday.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.72,0:02:55.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,On a date?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.73,0:02:59.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-No! I thought I might visit the science center with my friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.65,0:03:03.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'd've given you some extra\Npocket money if it was a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.19,0:03:03.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For real?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's actually a date, ain't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.00,0:03:07.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.70,0:03:10.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You should invite her here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We could have some hot pot or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.72,0:03:14.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki is coming to the birthday party.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.79,0:03:17.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the Hinazukis over on 5th?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.06,0:03:20.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, I'm giving her all the answers she wants.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.13,0:03:22.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just be careful when you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.51,0:03:25.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.44,0:03:28.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.74,0:03:30.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rise. Bow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.91,0:03:32.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the next Liveman look amazing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.64,0:03:35.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It does!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.68,0:03:36.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's a "falcon"?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're like eagles!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're so smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.00,0:03:43.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This Saturday, I'm going to get\NHinazuki out of her house.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.38,0:03:47.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or rather, away from her mother's abuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.76,0:03:48.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.69,0:03:49.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sen—sei!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't get this part. Could you explain it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.06,0:03:58.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ugh, they're so flirty with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.01,0:04:03.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you use to be just like them until recently?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.62,0:04:07.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Quit being stubborn and join them, yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Yo"? Are you tryin' to act cool?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.33,0:04:12.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.95,0:04:16.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei thinks I'm a thief.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.77,0:04:18.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And so do you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Guys, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.77,0:04:32.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we visit the\N science center on Saturday?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.37,0:04:34.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki's coming too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.03,0:04:35.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds goo—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.73,0:04:38.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's something I gotta do that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.87,0:04:41.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't go either, Satoru. I've got\Nsomething important to do too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.54,0:04:49.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I'd love to go, but I'm busy as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.01,0:04:51.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.74,0:04:54.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you're going with Hinazuki,\Nyou'd be better off without us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.85,0:04:55.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.42,0:05:00.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Something happen, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.15,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,53,,"I told them I can't hang out on Saturday\N'cause I've got a date with you."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I told them I can't hang out on Saturday\N'cause I've got a date with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I say that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.01,0:05:10.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I {\i0}did{\i1} say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.28,0:05:12.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.59,0:05:17.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,my mother told me to come straight home on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to take you somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.58,0:05:21.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to her for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.26,0:05:27.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could you drop by the staff room for a bit?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.11,0:05:31.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. I'm not going to allow\Ntwo kids to go out on their own.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.36,0:05:35.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're not just going to play.\NWe'll get to learn things!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.08,0:05:37.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can do that at home.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.24,0:05:40.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saturday's the day Kayo helps me at home.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Helps you? With what?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Releasing your pent-up stress?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.10,0:05:47.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see the need to answer that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.87,0:05:50.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you so against her going out?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can think of several reasons!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.20,0:05:57.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who do you think will have to \Ntake responsibility if something happens?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.21,0:06:01.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch has some nerve.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.27,0:06:06.27,GJM_Main,ew,0,0,0,,What do you get out of taking this gloomy girl out?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.27,0:06:09.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that? I just want to save my friend!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.82,0:06:11.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Save?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.43,0:06:13.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Save Kayo from what?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You think you're some knight in shining armor?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really shouldn't have hinted at her abuse!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.91,0:06:22.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How do you feel, Kayo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.67,0:06:24.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You want to go with him?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get your minds out of the gutter,\Nyou perverted kids!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.89,0:06:32.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.11,0:06:37.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go around calling kids perverted.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.53,0:06:40.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.33,0:06:47.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Half of it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.01,0:06:50.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Our kids are motivated about something,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.35,0:06:53.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so as their parents, shouldn't we help them out?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.39,0:06:58.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think our families are pretty similar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Drop by for a chat sometime.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get inside, Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.39,0:07:08.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-See you on Saturday. It's a promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.83,0:07:15.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't intrude, did I?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.54,0:07:17.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.19,0:07:23.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got off work early and \Njust happened to see you kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good thing I followed you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were following us?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I was obviously kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.20,0:07:33.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, things should be okay for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That girl was wearing surprisingly nice clothes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.96,0:07:40.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It shows that her mother is \Nconscious about appearances.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.45,0:07:43.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.17,0:07:44.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But after our conversation and looking at her mother, I can make a guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.91,0:07:50.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a former TV news reporter for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo's pretty cute, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.09,0:07:56.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're 29 years old! What are you blushing for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'd better not give up just yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.96,0:08:00.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saturday, February 27th.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a clear day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.71,0:08:13.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like Hinazuki's mother has thought\Ntwice about hitting her these past few days.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This guy's my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.77,0:08:18.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.07,0:08:22.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I love this place!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.27,0:08:26.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anyone around.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.07,0:08:29.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's like we snuck in. Exciting, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.53,0:08:33.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hide whenever I see anybody.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.25,0:08:36.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, she didn't ask me if I was stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.63,0:08:39.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take a peek into this thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna see the planetarium? It's just about to start.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got my fill of stars the other night.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.91,0:09:01.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.56,0:09:05.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to run to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be around.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.55,0:09:18.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Déjà vu?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did come here often,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but never with Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for inviting me today.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.65,0:09:40.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you know I liked this place too?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I know?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.11,0:09:44.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that why I chose this place?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.82,0:09:48.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do aspiring comic artists...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.53,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Do aspiring comic artists...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tend to come to places like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.92,0:09:58.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I remember having the same\Nconversation 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I came here by myself and ran into Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.16,0:10:04.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing. You think there's a connection?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I just repeating the past?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been trying to change the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.66,0:10:19.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have I been unwittingly following the same path?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.80,0:10:30.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.91,0:10:32.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your coat for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.83,0:10:36.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've already changed a bunch\Nof things with my actions.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.62,0:10:40.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that I can change the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.82,0:10:41.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.55,0:10:46.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I mustered up the courage to come.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.47,0:10:51.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.18,0:10:55.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.32,0:10:57.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got done early, so I came.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.58,0:10:58.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See? It changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are we interrupting?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.25,0:11:07.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.47,0:11:08.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.21,0:11:10.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, Satoru's such a gentleman!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.47,0:11:17.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.48,0:11:25.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Monday, but she's here on time.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Such a pretty face...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.44,0:11:36.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.39,0:11:38.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,D-Did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.12,0:11:38.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru's got guts!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna get married?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.13,0:11:43.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! They gotta get engaged first!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get what?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're starting morning homeroom.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.82,0:11:52.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki will be murdered tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.18,0:11:55.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on March 1st.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The real battle starts now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.64,0:12:00.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters, Hiromi!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's walk to school together.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.28,0:12:10.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.45,0:12:15.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.43,0:12:20.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, then. \NI'll come pick you up in the morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.63,0:12:28.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.88,0:12:31.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I left home a bit early.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.68,0:12:35.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}March 1st, 1988.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.25,0:12:39.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The day Hinazuki disappeared 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.84,0:12:42.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But today will be different.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.68,0:12:59.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're off.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.57,0:13:10.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The circumstances now are \Nquite different from 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru's got guts!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.88,0:13:17.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was targeted because she \Nwas always by herself at that park.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you guys better come tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.07,0:13:21.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.89,0:13:25.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's no longer the case as of a few days ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.55,0:13:29.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go to the kids' center.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm with her today.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.89,0:13:36.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to go home early today.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.31,0:13:38.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang out with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.61,0:13:40.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.89,0:13:42.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I win again.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.56,0:13:45.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're good!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.80,0:13:47.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, maybe not everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.03,0:13:51.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fujinuma. I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.78,0:13:55.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's snowing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up tomorrow, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.36,0:15:05.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said it as loud as I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.72,0:15:15.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that Hinazuki, her mother inside,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and anybody who might've been\Nlistening nearby got the message.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I'm right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.98,0:15:27.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}X-Day is almost over.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this really it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm such an idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell did I come here?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.02,0:16:00.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I definitely changed history today.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not even 6 a.m. yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.08,0:16:13.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What about breakfast?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't sleep a wink after that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just wanted to see Hinazuki as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.84,0:16:39.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.94,0:16:40.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are free now, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.26,0:16:51.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna party at your place.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then let's go shopp—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.54,0:16:55.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru and Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to help me with something.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why today of all days?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.67,0:17:07.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's probably cause we messed up\Nwhile on duty the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.00,0:17:07.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.96,0:17:09.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, this is heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did they seriously not wait for us?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's ice cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.04,0:17:19.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That'll be 5,000 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.16,0:17:19.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.61,0:17:25.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, the bill was \Nexactly 5,000 yen 18 years ago too.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.64,0:17:31.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I was so excited about my birthday\Nthat I used up every penny I had.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.66,0:17:36.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}I think my mother and I made a ton \Nof sandwiches and ate them by ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.87,0:17:41.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.85,0:17:46.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.85,0:17:49.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru! Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You planned all this in secret?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.33,0:17:59.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They said they wanted to do this,\Nso I gave 'em a hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.98,0:18:01.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that why we had to help after school?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.90,0:18:06.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we asked Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.78,0:18:09.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He told us it was Hinazuki's birthday too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.66,0:18:12.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, we just wanted to surprise you a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.74,0:18:17.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the cakes? Satoru insisted we get two.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.28,0:18:21.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't finish your present in time.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.15,0:18:27.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were working on something?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.06,0:18:28.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.38,0:18:32.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, so that's why she wanted\Nto leave so badly yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.41,0:18:36.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I almost had it done last night, but I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.14,0:18:38.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.51,0:18:39.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can give it to me later.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.07,0:18:45.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make sandwiches with \N5,000 yen's worth of ingredients!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? You used up all the money?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.37,0:18:53.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Making sandwiches in a big group was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.01,0:19:00.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike 18 years ago, we finished them all in one day.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's fun having friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.45,0:19:08.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki and I got a lot of presents from everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.57,0:19:10.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All of you, too. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.16,0:19:28.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll clean up.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You walk Hinazuki home.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.14,0:19:33.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's c-c-cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.17,0:19:34.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.19,0:19:38.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,B-Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.58,0:19:41.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.06,0:19:46.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I became friends with you and the others.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your present tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.71,0:19:51.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.{;___;}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. It's a promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.47,0:19:56.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.85,0:19:57.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.47,0:20:15.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made it through!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.38,0:20:18.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I changed history!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.02,0:20:27.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The guys were gone by the time I got home.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.87,0:20:31.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With my fatigue from the past\Ntwo days reaching its limit,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.51,0:20:34.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and my mind being freed from all the tension,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.69,0:20:40.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,2920)}I instantly collapsed into bed and slept like a log.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.63,0:20:45.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, I'm late!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.54,0:20:50.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not late, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-Safe...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.60,0:20:57.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So Kayo's the only one who's late.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The day after our birthday,\NHinazuki didn't come to school.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The promise we made at the end...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was never fulfilled.
